### MedScribe AI — HTTP examples (IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client)
### Pick a base URL:
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8086
# @baseUrl = https://baymax.eliooo.org

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 1. Start processing a report image (returns 202 + reportId)
# imageBase64: base64 of a JPEG/PNG. On macOS:  base64 -i report.png | tr -d '\n'
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageBase64": "<BASE64_IMAGE>",
  "patientContext": { "patientId": "DEMO-1", "age": 45, "gender": "MALE" }
}

### 2. Poll status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/query/status/RPT-XXXXXXXX

### 3. Results per stage
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-XXXXXXXX/ocr
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-XXXXXXXX/classification
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-XXXXXXXX/icd10
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-XXXXXXXX/snomedct
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-XXXXXXXX/insights
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/query/results/RPT-XXXXXXXX/all

### 4. Chat about the report
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/chat/RPT-XXXXXXXX/send
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Which value is most concerning and why?", "language": "en" }

### 5. Show a result in Bangla
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/RPT-XXXXXXXX/translate/CLINICAL_INSIGHTS?lang=bn

### 6. Free-text insights (no image)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/free-text-insights
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "HbA1c 7.8%, fasting glucose 140 mg/dL, LDL 160 mg/dL", "targetAudience": "PATIENT" }

### 7. Raw LLM call through the configured provider
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/llm/invoke
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userPrompt": "Explain HbA1c in one sentence.", "maxTokens": 200 }

### 8. Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-report/query/analytics/metrics

### Baymax (only when BAYMAX_ENABLED=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/baymax/health

### Baymax weekly pilot log as CSV (dates are UTC days, `to` exclusive; default = last 7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/baymax/admin/metrics/weekly?from=2026-09-05&to=2026-09-12
X-Baymax-Admin-Token: {{baymaxAdminToken}}

### Baymax storage self-test (put → presign → get → delete through the real adapter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/baymax/admin/storage/selftest
X-Baymax-Admin-Token: {{baymaxAdminToken}}

### Baymax onboarding (admin token until OTP arrives). Numbers must be E.164.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/baymax/families
Content-Type: application/json
X-Baymax-Admin-Token: {{baymaxAdminToken}}

{"whatsapp_number": "+8801700000000", "owner_name": "Rahim", "terms_accepted": true}

### Add a patient profile (free plan: 1 profile → second is 402 free_tier_patients)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/baymax/families/{{familyId}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json
X-Baymax-Admin-Token: {{baymaxAdminToken}}

{"name": "Ma", "age": 74, "sex": "female", "chronic_flags": ["diabetes", "hypertension"], "proxy_consent": true}

### Share a patient with one sibling number (second share → 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/baymax/patients/{{patientId}}/share
Content-Type: application/json
X-Baymax-Admin-Token: {{baymaxAdminToken}}

{"whatsapp_number": "+8801811111111"}

### Delete on request: hard delete, returns a receipt
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/baymax/families/{{familyId}}
X-Baymax-Admin-Token: {{baymaxAdminToken}}

### Baymax: upload a document (multipart; 1..n images or one PDF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/baymax/documents
X-Baymax-Admin-Token: {{baymaxAdminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="patient_id"

{{patientId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="report.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./report.jpg
------Boundary--

### Baymax: document status and, once DONE, the extracted items with their crop keys.
### A DONE document that had items we could not locate on the page also carries:
###   "unverified": { "values": 2, "medicines": 0, "follow_up": 1, "total": 3 }
### The field is absent when nothing was dropped.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/baymax/documents/{{documentId}}
X-Baymax-Admin-Token: {{baymaxAdminToken}}
